Tool of the Day
Sider AI

Browser Extension

Sider AI is an AI-powered browser assistant that provides access to multiple AI models, writing assistance, summarization, translation, and productivity features directly inside your browser.

How to set up Sider AI
1
Open the Sider AI website.
2
Install the browser extension.
3
Pin the extension to your browser toolbar.
4
Open any webpage.
5
Use Sider AI to summarize, explain, or interact with content.
6
Explore the available AI productivity features.
